Z||000004||Bob Englert||03-28-2001||12:00 AM||||Sorry I missed the original post, was out of town on business.<P>I don't have a web site yet but I do have scans of the badge colors on a PhotoPoint album at <A HREF="http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumIndex?u=942731&a=6898921" TARGET=_blank>http://albums.photopoint.com/j/AlbumIndex?u=942731&a=6898921</A> <P>The engraved Fiero name tags are $6 each except the gold and silver which are $8 each.  This includes USPS shipping.  <P>I will be at the swap meet next month at the Fiero Factory with several new badge designs.  One will be the Fiero Pegasus and Fiero GT Pegasus.  I am also working on a badge design with the Fiero Forum logo to make it easier to identify us all when we are together.<P>I will also be offering engraved front license plates and license plate frames.<P>Let me know what you might be interested in.  <P>Thanks!<P>------------------<BR>Bob<BR>2 - 87 GT's<BR>85 SE 4 cyl||||reg||1
